msgstr "Lire les marques de niveau d'eau"

#. Key:	Mission.Step.37.1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Backrooms/Private/BRMissionText.cpp(337)
#: Source/Backrooms/Private/BRMissionText.cpp(337)
msgctxt "BR,Mission.Step.37.1"
